// Auto-generated arcade-only SOURCEFILTER for MAME.
// Includes every driver source file with at least one GAME()/GAMEL() declaration.
// Files containing ONLY CONS()/COMP()/SYST() (console/computer/other) declarations
// are omitted entirely - that is what actually removes them from the build.
//
// Lines marked [MIXED] also contain non-arcade driver(s) that will still be compiled
// (can't split below file granularity) but can optionally be excluded from the runtime
// driver list with a `-drivername` line - see the companion .nonarcade-in-mixed-files.txt.
//
// Lines marked [HELPER] declare no driver of their own (pure implementation/support
// files, e.g. split out of a driver purely for compile-unit size) and are pulled in
// because their manufacturer directory has >=1 included arcade file - needed to avoid
// link errors, since MAME's own dependency scanner only catches same-named header/impl
// sibling pairs, not arbitrary cross-file symbol references within a directory.

